WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.168
&gt;&gt;.
&gt;&gt;&gt; THIS MORNING UKRAINIAN

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:05.171
PRESIDENT, VOLODYMYR ZELENSKY,
MADE A SURPRISE VISIT TO THE

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.441
NEWLY LIBERATED CITY OF KHERSON,
THIS IS DAYS AFTER THEY WERE

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:12.078
ABLE TO FORCE-OUT RUSSIAN TROOPS
THAT OCCUPIED IT.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:16.015
THIS WEEKEND FIGHTERS RETURNED
HOME, FAMILIES WERE REUNITED,

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.183
INCLUDING THIS SOLDIER WITH HIS
GRANDMOTHER.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:23.990
WATCH.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:34.400
&gt;&gt; DOESN'T THAT SAY EVERYTHING?
NIC ROBERTSON IS ON THE GROUND

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.270
IN KHERSON.
NIC, THAT SINGING THAT WE HEARD

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.372
AND ALL OF THE PEOPLE BEHIND
YOU.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:45.211
THIS WAS, I'M SURE UNIMAGINABLE
TO THEM FOR SO LONG.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.748
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AND IT'S STILL HARD
FOR IT TO SINK IN TO PEOPLE

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.650
HERE.
I'VE BEEN TALKING TO THEM AGAIN

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.219
TODAY, 72 HOURS AFTER THAT
LIBERATION.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:57.223
THEY STILL FEEL THEY CANNOT
REALLY SHOW THEIR TRUE EMOTIONS.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:00.426
PARTICULARLY THOSE BEATEN BY THE
RUSSIAN TROOPS.

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:03.529
THERE WERE PLENTY OF THOSE.
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY SAID HE WAS

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:06.966
HERE TO SEND A SIGNAL THAT HE
WANTED THE PEOPLE OF THE CITY TO

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.902
RECONNECT WITH THE REST OF THE
COUNTRY.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:12.305
THEY PUT UP A TEMPORARY CELL
PHONE TOWER OVER HERE TO HELP

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.308
PEOPLE GET A CONNECTION WITH
LOVED ONES.

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:19.913
BUT LITERALLY THE LAST FEW
MINUTES, A TRUCK, IT'S GOING TO

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:25.285
BE HARD FOR OUR CAMERAMAN TO GET
AROUND TO HERE BUT YOU SEE A BIG

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.754
BLUE TRUCK THAT JUST PULLED
AROUND HERE.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:32.859
THAT IS THE FIRST HUMANITARIAN
AID TO BE COMING INTO THE CITY.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:36.729
IT IS MUCH NEEDED.
THERE'S CELEBRATION HERE BUT

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:43.670
STILL COMING OUT OF THE DARKNESS
OF RUSSIAN OCCUPATION.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:51.711
THE JOYS OF KHERSON'S LIBERATION
KEEP ON GIVING.

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:57.016
HOW ARE YOU, SHE SAYS?
I SURVIVED HER FRIEND SAYS, BUT

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:03.890
THE RUSSIANS KICKED MY DOOR IN
AND STOLE EVERYTHING.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.727
THIS CITY ONCE HOME TO MORE THAN
A QUARTER MILLION PEOPLE IS

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:12.031
STILL CELEBRATING ITS FREEDOM
BUT BEGINNING TO COUNT THE COST

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:15.801
OF THE EIGHT-MONTH BRUTAL
OCCUPATION THEY ENDURED.

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:19.806
THE CITY'S PHONE AND INTERNET
CONNECTION CUT, RESIDENTS

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:23.843
CROWDING AROUND SOLDIERS'
COMMUNICATIONS IN DESPERATE HOPE

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:30.049
OF CONTACTING LOVED ONES.
ON THEIR WAY OUT, THE RUSSIANS

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.352
CRIPPLED ALMOST EVERY VITAL
SERVICE.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:36.990
ELECTRICITY OFF, AND WATER TOO.
THIS PUMP CLOSE TO THE RIVER

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.993
BANK GIVING WATER TOO POLLUTED
TO DRINK.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:43.029
THE WATER STOPPED WHEN THE POWER
WENT OFF HE SAYS.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:45.565
THIS IS THE FOURTH DAY WITHOUT
WATER.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:49.602
BUT WHAT CAN WE DO?
WE NEED TO SURVIVE SOMEHOW.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:55.608
&gt;&gt; THE RUSSIANS EVEN FELLED THE
CITY'S MAIN TV TRANSMITTER.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:59.412
THEY BLEW IT UP JUST BEFORE
LEAVING, A FINAL ACT OF

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:04.617
PUNISHMENT FOR A POPULATION THAT
UNTIL DAYS EARLIER THEY SAID WAS

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:08.254
PART OF RUSSIA AND WOULD BE
FOREVER.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:11.891
THAT SAME MESSAGE KHERSON AND
RUSSIA TOGETHER FOREVER BLAST

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:15.762
ERRED ON HUNDREDS OF BILLBOARDS
AROUND THE CITY, IS ALREADY

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:20.400
BEING TORN DOWN.
WHY?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.170
BECAUSE EIGHT MONTHS OF
OCCUPATION IS NOT VERY NICE.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:28.041
I DIDN'T FEEL VERY GOOD LIVING
IN FEAR THAT ANY MOMENT A CAR

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.243
COULD PULL OVER NEAR YOU AND
BRING YOU TO A VERY UNPLEASANT

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:38.951
PLACE.
ALEXANDER WAS UNLUCKY ENOUGH TO

00:03:38.951 --> 00:03:42.789
BE TAKEN TO ONE OF THOSE
UNPLEASANT PLACES AND SHOWS US

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:46.225
AROUND THE JAIL HE WAS IN.
SAYS THE RUSSIANS BEAT HIM

00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:48.428
DAILY.
THEY ABUSED EVERYONE.

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:52.632
KEPT US HUNGRY.
USED US AS FREE LABOR TO REPAIR

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:57.970
THEIR MILITARY VEHICLES HE SAYS.
THEY WERE BEATING US WHENEVER

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.640
THEY WANTED.
THIS IS WHERE THEY SAY RUSSIANS

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:04.377
KILLED PEOPLE FOR SHOUTING OUT
GLORY TO UKRAINE OR HAVING

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:08.280
TATTOOS SAYING THE SAME THING.
AND OVER HERE IN THIS ROOM, THIS

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:14.120
IS WHERE THEY USED TO TORTURE
PEOPLE.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.157
THE FIRE HE SAYS STARTED BY THE
RUSSIANS AS THEY LEFT TO COVER

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:26.933
UP THEIR CRIMES.
BUT IT IS ACROSS THE ROAD IN

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:31.471
KATERYNA'S CHURCH RUSSIA'S
ODDEST BRUTALITY WAS

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:38.511
PERPETRATED.
A GRAVE WAS LOOTED DAYS BEFORE

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:44.584
THE RUSSIANS LEFT.
FATHER VITALI TAKES US INTO THE

00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:48.654
GLOOMY CRYPT, SHOWS US WHERE HIS
COFFIN WAS STOLEN FROM.

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:52.525
HE LAY HERE FOR 240 YEARS
THROUGH MANY WARS HE SAYS.

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:55.661
WE HONORED HIM AS THE FOUNDER OF
KHERSON AND THEY TOOK HIM

00:04:55.661 --> 00:05:06.372
WITHOUT PERMISSION.
REPAIRS OF SOULS AND CITY HAVE

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:08.541
ONLY JUST BEGUN.
AND SOME OF THAT BEGINNING --

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:11.844
WELL, HE'S GOING TO PAN OVER TO
THE BLUE TRUCK.

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:14.981
LOOK TO THE PEOPLE GATHERED AT
THE BACK OF THAT HUMANITARIAN

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:16.983
TRUCK HERE.
THERE IS NO DRINKING WATER IN

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:19.452
THE CITY.
THERE IS NO ELECTRICITY.

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:23.489
THERE IS A SHORTAGE OF FOOD.
PEOPLE, THE WATER THEY HAVE IS

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.391
POLLUTED AS WE SAID IN THE
STORY.

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:26.725
IT IS VERY DIFFICULT FOR PEOPLE
HERE.

00:05:26.725 --> 00:05:30.329
SO IT'S NO SURPRISE FOR ME TO
SEE THEM GATHERED AROUND THE

00:05:30.329 --> 00:05:35.334
BACK OF THIS FIRST HUMANITARIAN
TRUCK TO COME INTO THE CITY TO

00:05:35.334 --> 00:05:38.771
SEE WHAT IT MIGHT OFFER THEM.
&gt;&gt; THE WINTER IS UPON US AND

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:42.141
THEM AND THAT'S GOING TO IMPACT
THE WAR.

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:45.845
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IT CERTAINLY IS.
THE WAR IS LITERALLY -- THIS

00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:49.849
TOWN IS NOW ON THE FRONT LINE OF
COURSE, THE RUSSIANS JUST ACROSS

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:53.786
THE RIVER.
YOU ROUTINELY HEAR BARRAGES OF

00:05:53.786 --> 00:05:56.822
OUTGOING FIRE WE WERE DOWN AT
THE RIVER EARLY ON, YOU CAN'T

00:05:56.822 --> 00:06:00.326
SEE THE RUSSIANS ON THE OTHER
SIDE BUT THEY'RE DUG IN.

00:06:00.326 --> 00:06:03.796
SEEMS THE WINTER PERHAPS WILL
FREEZE THE LINE HERE.

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:07.667
BUT IT'S GOING TO TAKE SOME
TIME.

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:10.136
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY SAID WE'RE
MOVING FORWARD, THAT'S STILL THE

00:06:10.136 --> 00:06:11.737
MESSAGE.
THEY WANT TO TAKE MORE

00:06:11.737 --> 00:06:13.840
TERRITORY.
BUT FOR SURE THE WINTER IS GOING

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:18.911
TO BE BRUTAL AND HARD HERE.
AT NIGHT SUBZERO TEMPERATURES.

00:06:18.911 --> 00:06:23.182
THE CITY DOESN'T HAVE HEATING.
IT GETS COLD HERE AT NIGHT.

00:06:23.182 --> 00:06:25.184
&gt;&gt; NIC ROBERTSON WE'RE SO GLAD
YOU AND YOUR TEAM ARE THERE.

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:27.420
THANK YOU FOR THAT REMARKABLE
REPORTING.

